<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss 1996 car imports fall 1.1 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Swiss 1996 car imports fall 1.1 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss car imports fell 1.1 percent in 1996 to 268,686 cars from 271,601 in 1995, the Swiss Car Importers Association said.</p>
<p>In December car imports rose 10.1 percent to 15,469 from</p>
<p>14,050.</p>
<p>  Leading exporters	    1996	    1995</p>
<p>    Germany			122,718	 125,640</p>
<p>    France			 38,896	  40,678</p>
<p>    Italy			  21,269	  18,666</p>
<p>    Japan			  54,814	  56,942</p>
<p>    Sweden			 7,842	   7,813</p>
<p>    Britain			3,873	   2,984</p>
<p>    South Korea		  4,543	   4,647</p>
<p>--Zurich Newsroom 41-1-2587340</p>
</text>
